{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27619","headline":"题于越亭 · 张祜","name":"题于越亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扁舟亭下驻烟波，十五年游重此过。\n洲觜露沙人渡浅，树稍藏竹鸟啼多。\n山衔落照欹红盖，水蹙斜文卷绿罗。\n肠断中秋正圆月，夜来谁唱异乡歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}